# f1 = forFractions, f2 = forWholeNumbers, f3 = forTexts, f4 = forNobodyKnowsWhat
# A list made with a length is born for all that Link sees stored into lists born at that place; where Link has no word (the list went to unseen code) the first loop's word stands and the site remembers what its lists became.
